@host = http://localhost:5113
@taskId = REPLACE_AFTER_CREATE

### List all tasks
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Create a task
# Copy the returned id into the @taskId variable above.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write release notes"
}

### Get a single task
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}
Accept: application/json

### Toggle completion
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/toggle

### Delete a task
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Liveness probe
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness probe
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Validation failure — empty title returns 422
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### Not found — random id returns 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
